@*
    Sosyal Sorumluluk Projelerimiz (new Kurumsal navigation item, 2026-09-28
    client request). Title/description/canonical/OG/WebPage schema come from
    ViewData["Seo"] + ViewData["SeoPageType"], set in
    SocialResponsibilityController.Index via ISeoService — see
    _Layout.cshtml's <head> and SeoStructuredDataViewComponent.

    Intentionally empty content page — no real copy/projects/imagery has
    been supplied yet, so this renders only the shared Breadcrumb + the
    shared Section Header (existing _SectionHeader.cshtml/SectionHeaderModel,
    reused as-is, no new component) with just a title. No placeholder text,
    Lorem Ipsum, invented projects or imagery — ready for real content to be
    added later with no structural change needed.
*@

@{
    var breadcrumbTrail = new List<AncinInsaat.ViewComponents.BreadcrumbItem>
    {
        new() { Label = "Sosyal Sorumluluk Projelerimiz" }
    };
}
@await Component.InvokeAsync("Breadcrumb", new { trail = breadcrumbTrail, homeLabel = "Anasayfa" })

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <partial name="_SectionHeader" model="@(new AncinInsaat.Models.SectionHeaderModel { Title = "Sosyal Sorumluluk Projelerimiz" })" />
    </div>
</section>
